Package: xclawer
Version: 1.0.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8)
Maintainer: mikiya
Description: X.com tweet scraper with news radar and web console
 Collects tweets from X.com via Playwright, filters and scores them with
 AI (DeepSeek), runs an RSS + X news radar with WeChat push, and serves
 a web console on port 5001.
 .
 The virtualenv is bundled in the package. Data (database, browser
 session, logs, scheduler state) lives in /var/lib/xclawer;
 configuration lives in /etc/xclawer/.env.
